{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，S01、S05这类短停留段里，未标“到时出现”的感受词仍然偏密，个别意象如“我与你的亲密关系”也略显生硬，X在这些地方更利落。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"平\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的【】让我能迅速抓住每段的情绪落点，按乐句出现的感受词又补出了情绪和音乐的具体变化，不必一次读完所有细节。更重要的是，Y把怕添负担、因对方没有退开而放松、逐渐期待互相依靠、害怕失去，到最后不再索要永远的保证，连成了一条更完整的心理变化线。X的语言更利落自然，但一些关键的心理层次和音乐中的细微变化被压缩掉了。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9de9a569-fc75-4df2-8bbe-495d8acd460c", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T061127663823Z", "elapsed_seconds": 144.656, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T06:13:52.332792+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "bc39464d5e71dfe35ef3513e3493cc3de273c6bab166ff43a7c2d232b8dbadc4", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attach